FerrionOS change to userutils (MIT license, kept), made against upstream commit 641a5aa81574db79d883151bc3438d3e59f90b88 with ferrion-login-name.patch applied:
- login applies the account's scheme namespace from /etc/login_schemes.toml to every login, with or without a password, through one shared login_session helper.

